   <section v-if="showSection('acceptance')" aria-label="验收证据"><h4>{{ acceptanceScope==='task-directory'?'任务目录验收':acceptanceScope==='technical-sample'?'技术样例验收':'执行范围待核对' }}</h4><p>任务勾选、自动测试和真实业务验收分别核对；按钮不会把缺失证据改成通过。</p><label v-for="e in details?.evidence??[]" :key="e.ref" class="evidence-row"><input v-model="selectedEvidence" type="checkbox" :value="e.digest" :disabled="recordLocked||record.state!=='completed'"><span>{{ e.ref }} · {{ e.kind }} · {{ e.state }}<small>{{ e.digest }}</small>{{ e.summary }}</span></label><p v-if="!details?.evidence?.length">尚无可核对的证据内容。</p><template v-if="record.state==='completed'&&acceptanceScope!=='unverified'"><label for="workflow-acceptance-note">本次验收结论与依据</label><textarea id="workflow-acceptance-note" v-model="acceptanceNote" maxlength="4000" :disabled="recordLocked"/><el-button :disabled="recordLocked||!acceptanceNote.trim()||!selectedEvidence.length" @click="accept">{{ acceptanceScope==='task-directory'?'提交任务目录验收':'提交技术样例验收' }}</el-button></template></section>
